	(text "PULL-CONFIG CONTRACT: RP2350 internal pull-up/-down MUST be disabled in BOTH firmware images on GP12 GP13 GP14 GP15 GP16 GP27 GP18 GP19 GP20 GP21; the only pull on each dry-contact pin is the board external 47k 1 % pull-up to 3V3_MCU. Nominal LOW = 3.3 V x 10k / (10k + 47k) = 0.579 V < VIL max 0.8 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 288.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))
	(text "J8/J9 RU3100 single-ended TTL (TTL mode selected via IO-Link): encoder A/B drive J8/J9 pins 3/5 (A+/B+); A-/B- (pins 4/6) are held at the 2.5 V mid-bias by R38-R45 10k 1 % and C14-C17 100 nF; the R1-R4 120 ohm differential terminators are removed." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 293.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))
